{"title": "Forest Aegis", "pageid": 30405, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Forest_Aegis", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Forest Aegis</b> is a passive feature that grants the user <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Barkskin_(Condition)\" title=\"Barkskin (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Barkskin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Barkskin_(Condition)\" title=\"Barkskin (Condition)\">Barkskin</a>, setting their AC to 16.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You are invested with the power of the meadows and woods of the land, and have the effect of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Barkskin_(Condition)\" title=\"Barkskin (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Barkskin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Barkskin_(Condition)\" title=\"Barkskin (Condition)\">Barkskin</a>, increasing your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> to 16. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Barkskin_Armour\" title=\"Barkskin Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Hide_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Hide_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Hide_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Hide_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Hide_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Hide_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Hide_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Hide_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Hide_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Barkskin_Armour\" title=\"Barkskin Armour\">Barkskin Armour</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Barkskin_(Condition)\" title=\"Barkskin (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Barkskin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Barkskin_(Condition)\" title=\"Barkskin (Condition)\">Barkskin</a> from <b>Forest Aegis</b> does not remain active while in <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\">Wild Shape</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715005740\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1772/1000000\nPo